{
  "_comment": "Per-version label maps. Each map derives the full expected sequence of rendered line units from a JSON report. A map is accepted for a (version, renderer) pair only if the label-map validation case (role label_map_validation) matches exactly; otherwise every row of that pair is NOT_EXECUTED. Text values are the visible text after HTML rendering, whitespace-normalized.",
